# Paradise Nursery Shopping Application

A React and Redux shopping cart application for Paradise Nursery, an online plant shop.

## Features

- Paradise Nursery landing page
- Company About Us page
- Plant listing with 3 categories
- 18 unique houseplants
- Add to Cart functionality
- Dynamic cart item count
- Increase/decrease quantity
- Remove items from cart
- Individual plant totals
- Overall cart total
- Checkout "Coming Soon" message
- Continue Shopping functionality
- Responsive design

## Technologies

- React
- Redux Toolkit
- React Redux
- React Router
- Vite
- CSS
